                 in full on 5 October 2026 from the filed copy. Pp. 52-56 the
                 county in 1930 and the legislative road to the 1930 enabling
                 act (the 1928 amendment to Const. sec. 110; H.B. 342 of 1930,
                 which "actually confined the Act to Arlington" by its density
                 class); pp. 57-64 the campaign, who was for and against and
