                 rose1976's 1,936 to 428 and 1,689 to 1,149
                 (at-large-vote-1930), and the sentence that adoption "would
                 result in the first adoption by an electorate of the County
                 Manager form of government in the United States", the claim
                 county-manager-statutes-other-states leaves unconfirmed, here
