                 the Circuit Court ruling that the Board should appoint
                 department heads. The report of the day, sun1951rulingboard,
                 has the ruling go for the Board on department heads and says
                 the police chief was not at issue, a special act giving that
                 appointment to the manager, so this line is the account that
                 runs against it.
