  urldate     = {2026-10-01},
  annotation  = {Arlington's delegation - State Senator Charles R. Fenwick and
                 Delegates George Damm and J. Maynard Magruder - set out "A
                 tentative list of 19 proposals to be introduced at the coming
                 session of the General Assembly on January 9" at a conference
                 at the Washington Golf and Country Club, "subject to revisions
